    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581">

                <pb facs="0798" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg788"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00115 EW/6–1145: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-11T19:00:00-04:00">June 11, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>991. To extent situation warrants it and your Brit colleague supports you, you
                    should request local authorities place under house arrest or stricter measures
                    of control where applicable all German officials and agents designated by you
                    stating US and Brit Govts making every effort expedite prompt repatriation these
                    categories.</p>
                <p>Report results.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Lisbon, Dublin, Bern, Stockholm and Tangier.<anchor n="8"
                        xml:id="d581-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d581-f1" n="8" xml:id="d581-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to Lisbon as 981, to Dublin as 102, to Bern as 2015, to Stockholm as
                    1102, and to Tangier as 123.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
